1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,159
In 2025, a dog woke a
Himalayan village at midnight.

2
00:00:03,209 --> 00:00:04,832
No warning reached them.

3
00:00:04,882 --> 00:00:05,863
And when relief comes,

4
00:00:05,913 --> 00:00:07,657
nobody can see where it goes.

5
00:00:07,707 --> 00:00:10,199
This is Pukaar Raahat.

6
00:00:10,399 --> 00:00:12,738
On the night of 30 June 2025,

7
00:00:12,789 --> 00:00:14,354
cloudbursts hit Mandi district:

8
00:00:14,404 --> 00:00:16,751
at least 10 dead, 34 missing.

9
00:00:16,801 --> 00:00:18,282
Relief is paid after the water,

10
00:00:18,332 --> 00:00:20,201
and the village can't check who got it.

11
00:00:20,251 --> 00:00:22,030
Money before the water works.

12
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:23,614
In Bangladesh in 2020,

13
00:00:23,664 --> 00:00:26,766
the World Food Programme
sent $53 by mobile money,

14
00:00:26,816 --> 00:00:28,270
about a week before the flood peaked,

15
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:30,567
to over 23,000 households.

16
00:00:30,617 --> 00:00:32,359
They were 52% less likely

17
00:00:32,409 --> 00:00:34,164
to go a day without eating.

18
00:00:34,564 --> 00:00:37,003
Today, Pukaar warns
villages before a flood,

19
00:00:37,053 --> 00:00:38,141
live on AWS.

20
00:00:38,191 --> 00:00:39,171
Raahat adds the money:

21
00:00:39,221 --> 00:00:40,200
released before the river,

22
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:41,133
on a sealed rule,

23
00:00:41,183 --> 00:00:43,198
every rupee on a public chain.

24
00:00:43,598 --> 00:00:45,756
The rule is set before the monsoon:

25
00:00:45,806 --> 00:00:47,404
at Warning, ₹1,500 per household;

26
00:00:47,454 --> 00:00:49,708
once the flood is confirmed, ₹4,000 more;

27
00:00:49,758 --> 00:00:51,618
then a 72-hour cooldown.

28
00:00:51,668 --> 00:00:52,957
Then it's sealed on chain.

29
00:00:53,006 --> 00:00:54,375
Nobody can change it mid-flood,

30
00:00:54,425 --> 00:00:55,332
not even us.

31
00:00:55,382 --> 00:00:56,683
Now July 2023,

32
00:00:56,733 --> 00:00:57,972
replayed on the deployed stack,

33
00:00:58,022 --> 00:00:59,700
labelled as an exercise.

34
00:00:59,750 --> 00:01:00,895
Pandoh reaches Warning.

35
00:01:00,945 --> 00:01:02,594
The officer approves the Hindi alert

36
00:01:02,644 --> 00:01:03,713
in one tap.

37
00:01:04,513 --> 00:01:05,162
As it goes out,

38
00:01:05,212 --> 00:01:07,121
the alert is anchored on Base.

39
00:01:07,171 --> 00:01:09,094
Re-verify fetches the public alert feed

40
00:01:09,144 --> 00:01:10,556
and hashes it in your browser.

41
00:01:10,605 --> 00:01:11,766
It matches.

42
00:01:11,966 --> 00:01:13,218
Code checks the sealed rule:

43
00:01:13,268 --> 00:01:14,348
Pandoh is at Warning,

44
00:01:14,398 --> 00:01:16,017
30 households registered.

45
00:01:16,067 --> 00:01:17,329
One tap releases tier one,

46
00:01:17,379 --> 00:01:18,268
before the water:

47
00:01:18,318 --> 00:01:20,453
30 times ₹1,500.

48
00:01:20,503 --> 00:01:22,166
The contract checks the rule again,

49
00:01:22,216 --> 00:01:23,192
and pays.

50
00:01:23,992 --> 00:01:24,705
After the flood,

51
00:01:24,755 --> 00:01:26,947
three independent keys can confirm it.

52
00:01:26,997 --> 00:01:28,585
Pandoh's pradhan attests first,

53
00:01:28,635 --> 00:01:30,693
from a verified photo of the village.

54
00:01:31,293 --> 00:01:32,752
The district officer attests,

55
00:01:32,802 --> 00:01:34,168
severity two.

56
00:01:34,218 --> 00:01:35,112
Two of three agree:

57
00:01:35,162 --> 00:01:36,688
the flood is confirmed.

58
00:01:36,738 --> 00:01:38,982
And the satellite adds a third.

59
00:01:39,582 --> 00:01:41,186
Sentinel-2 images of the river,

60
00:01:41,236 --> 00:01:42,433
before and after:

61
00:01:42,483 --> 00:01:46,338
water went from 2.07 to
4.10 square kilometres.

62
00:01:46,388 --> 00:01:47,367
Severity three.

63
00:01:47,417 --> 00:01:48,752
The image's hash goes on chain,

64
00:01:48,802 --> 00:01:50,509
so anyone can check it.

65
00:01:50,709 --> 00:01:52,249
Confirmation unlocks tier two:

66
00:01:52,298 --> 00:01:54,443
₹4,000 for each household.

67
00:01:54,493 --> 00:01:56,974
The contract checks the three keys itself.

68
00:01:58,174 --> 00:02:01,296
The pradhan records each
payment's UPI reference.

69
00:02:01,346 --> 00:02:03,584
On chain, it's a receipt
for a hashed household:

70
00:02:03,634 --> 00:02:04,267
no name,

71
00:02:04,316 --> 00:02:05,556
no phone number.

72
00:02:06,156 --> 00:02:07,855
It all lands on one public page:

73
00:02:07,905 --> 00:02:09,316
the alert, both tranches,

74
00:02:09,367 --> 00:02:10,213
three confirmations,

75
00:02:10,263 --> 00:02:11,432
the receipts.

76
00:02:11,482 --> 00:02:12,994
Anyone can open every transaction:

77
00:02:13,044 --> 00:02:13,485
no wallet,

78
00:02:13,535 --> 00:02:14,570
no account.

79
00:02:14,670 --> 00:02:15,404
Why a chain?

80
00:02:15,454 --> 00:02:17,158
A rule nobody can quietly change,

81
00:02:17,209 --> 00:02:19,057
a confirmation no one person controls,

82
00:02:19,107 --> 00:02:20,775
receipts anyone can audit.

83
00:02:20,825 --> 00:02:22,146
And if the chain is down,

84
00:02:22,196 --> 00:02:23,751
the warning still goes out.

85
00:02:23,951 --> 00:02:25,600
Read from Base Sepolia right now:

86
00:02:25,650 --> 00:02:26,349
the rule sealed,

87
00:02:26,399 --> 00:02:28,003
the alert marked as an exercise,

88
00:02:28,053 --> 00:02:28,888
three attesters,

89
00:02:28,938 --> 00:02:29,773
both tranches,

90
00:02:29,823 --> 00:02:30,796
the receipt.

91
00:02:30,846 --> 00:02:32,166
53 contract tests,

92
00:02:32,217 --> 00:02:33,465
full coverage.

93
00:02:33,665 --> 00:02:34,612
What's not real yet:

94
00:02:34,662 --> 00:02:36,461
the money is a test token.

95
00:02:36,511 --> 00:02:38,242
The amounts await the
state's relief norms,

96
00:02:38,293 --> 00:02:40,736
and our server holds the testnet keys.

97
00:02:41,136 --> 00:02:42,243
The river will still rise.

98
00:02:42,294 --> 00:02:44,052
Now help reaches first.
